WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.422
Welcome to Module 4. Up to now, many of our variables have held one value at a time.

00:00:07.422 --> 00:00:13.587
Lists and tuples let us organize several related values inside one object.

00:00:13.587 --> 00:00:22.812
That matters in analytics because we usually work with collections: several scores, several sales values, several ages,

00:00:22.812 --> 00:00:24.233
or several records.

00:00:24.867 --> 00:00:32.419
We’ll learn how to create these collections, access individual values, update lists, loop through them, summarize them,

00:00:32.419 --> 00:00:37.224
and decide when a list or tuple is the better choice.
